METHOD:: name
METHOD:: zero
METHOD:: unit

METHOD:: mul
Two values met one after the other.

METHOD:: join
Two values between which to choose.

METHOD:: leq
Whether a is below b: joining them gives b.

METHOD:: coerce
A value from what a rule answers: true is the unit, false and nil the zero, a number itself (as a Float).
